Having trouble with Sports Dominance? Here are the quick answers, and how to reach us.

Common questions

How do I restore my purchases?
Open the App, go to More > Settings, and tap Restore Purchases. Your sport unlocks, All-Access, Remove Ads and other one-time purchases come back on the same Apple ID or Google account.

Which sport is free?
One sport is free in each store region (the region's most popular sport). The other six are one-time unlocks, or all of them together with All-Access.

My progress was lost. Can I get it back?
Saves live on your device. If cloud save is on (Settings > Cloud Save), your run is also in your iCloud or Google Play Games account and comes back after a reinstall or on a new device. Without cloud save, a deleted App cannot be recovered.

The game is crashing or not loading.
Close the App completely and reopen it. Make sure you have the latest version from the store, then restart your device. If it keeps happening, send a bug report from Settings (below): it carries the build number and a save fingerprint so we can reproduce it.

How do I turn off ads?
Remove Ads in the in-game Store removes banner and interstitial ads for good. Rewarded videos stay optional; you only ever see one when you tap an offer.

How do I change the language?
More > Settings > Language. The App ships with 25 languages.

Send feedback or report a bug
More > Settings > Send feedback / Report a bug. You type it, we read it in real time. No account needed.

